# A mode word sitting ahead of every opener, and then a bare opener with
# nothing at all behind it. The latch that remembers a mode word is per block,
# so the stray word can't reach forward across the opener to arm the block it
# precedes, and the bare block behind that opener completes nothing on its own.
# Neither operand ends up carrying a record anybody could pair, so intake
# refuses patch1 outright with the no-patch line at exit 1 rather than
# validating an operand whose only metadata is junk sitting between sections.
bin: DIFFOFDIFFS
args: patch1 patch2
exit: 1
